      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783882633594,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Non-functional requirement ***\n1. observability: million of users can use large volume of\nmessage. Depend on volume, log can be costly.\nMonitoring\nand alerting be in place for health and perf metrics\n2. Device (desktop/mobile)\n3. Demographic\n4. accessibility: WCAG, screen reader support,\nhigh contrast mode, key assessibilty\n5. Performance: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Non-functional requirement ***\n1. observability: million of users can use large volume of \nmessage. Depend on volume, log can be costly. Monitoring\nand alerting be in place for health and perf metrics\n2. Device (desktop/mobile)\n3. Demographic\n4. accessibility: WCAG, screen reader support,\nhigh contrast mode, key assessibilty\n5. Performance: ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
