    {
      "id": "sC-m-sN7tpMlqODEGja8T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -376.9375,
      "y": 376.80078125,
      "width": 624.4794921875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1754568324,
      "version": 1311,
      "versionNonce": 2032790612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783913987194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Sending Gurantees\n1. message appears immediately/persisted locally\n2. message assigned a client-generated ID\n3. message enters an outgoing queue\n4. transport attempts delivery\n5. server ack messages and assigns its canonical server ID and \nsequences, local record is reconciled without duplicating msg\n-- Receiving guarantees\n1. message arrive through persistent connection\n2. duplicate event will not produce duplicate message\n3. message arrived out of order must be re-ordered\n4. missed event must be recovered after reconnect\n5. server should remain SOT for ordering/delivery state\n-- Offline gurantees\n1. Browse locally cached conversations\n2. open previously loaded messages\n3. compose & send message into persistent queue, \nretry automatically when connectivity returns. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Sending Gurantees\n1. message appears immediately/persisted locally\n2. message assigned a client-generated ID\n3. message enters an outgoing queue\n4. transport attempts delivery\n5. server ack messages and assigns its canonical server ID and \nsequences, local record is reconciled without duplicating msg\n-- Receiving guarantees\n1. message arrive through persistent connection\n2. duplicate event will not produce duplicate message\n3. message arrived out of order must be re-ordered\n4. missed event must be recovered after reconnect\n5. server should remain SOT for ordering/delivery state\n-- Offline gurantees\n1. Browse locally cached conversations\n2. open previously loaded messages\n3. compose & send message into persistent queue, \nretry automatically when connectivity returns. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
