    },
    {
      "id": "rtea1akMyiVt-HsVOO5Q3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640.1577093672363,
      "y": 2694.1252551531743,
      "width": 683.279541015625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2026801516,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 873691116,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783902489145,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the cursor has expired, perform a broader resynchronization:\n* reload recent conversations,\n* fetch messages after the latest sequence for active conversations,\n* reconcile pending outgoing messages.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If the cursor has expired, perform a broader resynchronization:\n* reload recent conversations,\n* fetch messages after the latest sequence for active conversations,\n* reconcile pending outgoing messages.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NSPhjMsyj1in7WcF6M8Nq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1063.9235574638399,
      "y": 2811.9291202272952,
      "width": 627.3381545261543,
      "height": 38.407857552139845,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186893140,
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 1396144340,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783914780343,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Handle Message ordering correctly ***",
      "fontSize": 30.726286041711855,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Handle Message ordering correctly ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZcM6oWlqTPC3-2jjaC9UB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1049.761380564596,
      "y": 2846.354551066162,
      "width": 581.2994995117188,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 547779540,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 797021268,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783902566526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client timestamps cannot establish canonical order because:\n* device clocks may be incorrect,\n* messages can be retried,\n* concurrent devices can send messages,\n* events may arrive out of order.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client timestamps cannot establish canonical order because:\n* device clocks may be incorrect,\n* messages can be retried,\n* concurrent devices can send messages,\n* events may arrive out of order.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YMj-mr-ZbZ1Vj9VGCB3_G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1639.5699696220818,
      "y": 2882.465281008457,
      "width": 63,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 875102292,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 1026582228,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783902591258,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "====> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "====> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oxelQ1JorHvrY-ksh9I4s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1799.6608723662566,
      "y": 2843.947169070009,
      "width": 604.1395263671875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1691117396,
      "version": 28,
      "versionNonce": 937040980,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783902621369,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Render canonical messages by sequence.\nFor optimistic messages without a sequence:\n* temporarily place them after confirmed messages,\n* order multiple optimistic messages using createdAtClient,\n* reposition them when the server sequence arrives.\nFor eg: GET /conversations/:id/messages?afterSequence=102\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Render canonical messages by sequence.\nFor optimistic messages without a sequence:\n* temporarily place them after confirmed messages,\n* order multiple optimistic messages using createdAtClient,\n* reposition them when the server sequence arrives.\nFor eg: GET /conversations/:id/messages?afterSequence=102\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zrmCojvgw1cApATUyG1_u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1044.94661657229,
      "y": 3002.342420889993,
      "width": 432.81878662109375,
      "height": 39.936251903032385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 339261420,
      "version": 90,
      "versionNonce": 2145620332,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783914789929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Handle multiple tabs ***",
      "fontSize": 31.949001522425906,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Handle multiple tabs ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tnLzuGGra0KItPSle7wu2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1046.0474988177195,
      "y": 3053.9486325743815,
      "width": 1015.5792846679688,
      "height": 975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1836402260,
      "version": 278,
      "versionNonce": 1586925524,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783903249476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IndexedDB is accessible from all tabs, so every tab can read the same persisted data.\nFor immediate cross-tab notification, use:\n* BroadcastChannel, preferably,\n* storage events as a limited fallback.\n\nOption1: each tab owns a WebSocket\nPros\n* Simple.\n* No leader-election complexity.\n* Each tab is independently functional.\nCons:\n* More server connections.\n* Duplicate event processing.\n* Potentially duplicate outbox workers.\n* More battery and network usage.\n\nOption2: one leader tab owns networking. One tab becomes leader and owns:\n* WebSocket connection.\n* Outbox scheduler.\n* Reconnect logic.\n* Heartbeats.\nFollower tabs:\n* render from IndexedDB,\n* write user actions into IndexedDB,\n* notify the leader through BroadcastChannel.\nLeader election options:\n* Web Locks API.\n* Lease record in IndexedDB.\n* BroadcastChannel heartbeat protocol.\n=====\nOption3: SharedWorker alternative. A SharedWorker can own one socket shared across same-origin tabs.\nPros:\n* Natural centralized connection.\n* No application-level leader election.\n* Efficient cross-tab communication.\nCons:\n* More limited browser and platform support.\n* Harder debugging and lifecycle semantics.\n* Not universally suitable for mobile web environments.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IndexedDB is accessible from all tabs, so every tab can read the same persisted data.\nFor immediate cross-tab notification, use:\n* BroadcastChannel, preferably,\n* storage events as a limited fallback.\n\nOption1: each tab owns a WebSocket\nPros\n* Simple.\n* No leader-election complexity.\n* Each tab is independently functional.\nCons:\n* More server connections.\n* Duplicate event processing.\n* Potentially duplicate outbox workers.\n* More battery and network usage.\n\nOption2: one leader tab owns networking. One tab becomes leader and owns:\n* WebSocket connection.\n* Outbox scheduler.\n* Reconnect logic.\n* Heartbeats.\nFollower tabs:\n* render from IndexedDB,\n* write user actions into IndexedDB,\n* notify the leader through BroadcastChannel.\nLeader election options:\n* Web Locks API.\n* Lease record in IndexedDB.\n* BroadcastChannel heartbeat protocol.\n=====\nOption3: SharedWorker alternative. A SharedWorker can own one socket shared across same-origin tabs.\nPros:\n* Natural centralized connection.\n* No application-level leader election.\n* Efficient cross-tab communication.\nCons:\n* More limited browser and platform support.\n* Harder debugging and lifecycle semantics.\n* Not universally suitable for mobile web environments.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
