      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// 1. CONTEXT INSTANTIATION\n// Creates or connects to a globally accessible message pipeline on the client\nconst appChannel = new BroadcastChannel('system_bus');\n\n// 2. INBOUND EVENT DISPATCHER (The Listener)\n// Acts as a gateway receiver for any events originating from external tabs/workers\nappChannel.onmessage = (event) => {\n  const { type, payload } = event.data;\n\n  // Route messages based on event type\n  switch (type) {\n    case 'STATE_SYNC':\n      updateLocalState(payload);\n      break;\n    case 'RPC_CALL':\n      executeRemoteCommand(payload);\n      break;\n    default:\n      console.warn('Unhandled cluster event:', type);\n  }\n};\n\n// 3. OUTBOUND BROADERCASTER (The Publisher)\n// Standardized wrapper to ship decoupled commands into the message bus\nfunction broadcastEvent(type, payload = {}) {\n  appChannel.postMessage({ type, payload });\n}\n\n// 4. RESOURCE LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT (Cleanup)\n// Prevents memory leaks by unlinking the context before destruction\nfunction destroySystemBus() {\n  appChannel.close();\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 13.451026307927508,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// 1. CONTEXT INSTANTIATION\n// Creates or connects to a globally accessible message pipeline on the client\nconst appChannel = new BroadcastChannel('system_bus');\n\n// 2. INBOUND EVENT DISPATCHER (The Listener)\n// Acts as a gateway receiver for any events originating from external tabs/workers\nappChannel.onmessage = (event) => {\n  const { type, payload } = event.data;\n\n  // Route messages based on event type\n  switch (type) {\n    case 'STATE_SYNC':\n      updateLocalState(payload);\n      break;\n    case 'RPC_CALL':\n      executeRemoteCommand(payload);\n      break;\n    default:\n      console.warn('Unhandled cluster event:', type);\n  }\n};\n\n// 3. OUTBOUND BROADERCASTER (The Publisher)\n// Standardized wrapper to ship decoupled commands into the message bus\nfunction broadcastEvent(type, payload = {}) {\n  appChannel.postMessage({ type, payload });\n}\n\n// 4. RESOURCE LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT (Cleanup)\n// Prevents memory leaks by unlinking the context before destruction\nfunction destroySystemBus() {\n  appChannel.close();\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
