      "updated": 1783914794369,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** How to prevent multiple tab send the same outbox *** ",
      "fontSize": 32.45315435096637,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** How to prevent multiple tab send the same outbox *** ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wwgJtpB9a9L2rj6iCvAL_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1771.0271242328997,
      "y": 4086.853587058321,
      "width": 382.019775390625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1809209300,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1342404204,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783903519049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "{\n  leaseOwner: tabId,\n  leaseExpiresAt: Date.now() + 15_000\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "{\n  leaseOwner: tabId,\n  leaseExpiresAt: Date.now() + 15_000\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sUxqHOg79az2hSyE4epAs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1033.5467848834805,
      "y": 4091.384323574849,
      "width": 676.7594604492188,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272106220,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 450275948,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783903515054,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Only the owner can send it.\n-- If tab crashes, the lease expires and another worker retries it.\n\nThis is similar to a distributed job queue, implemented locally.\nIf two tabs race successfully due to an edge case, \nthe server-side idempotency key prevents duplicate message creation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Only the owner can send it.\n-- If tab crashes, the lease expires and another worker retries it.\n\nThis is similar to a distributed job queue, implemented locally.\nIf two tabs race successfully due to an edge case, \nthe server-side idempotency key prevents duplicate message creation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "253vw17zEjEo-iZWAnfMT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -394.4658528509119,
      "y": 938.4928349890153,
      "width": 412.89971923828125,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1440579052,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 998934764,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783913976015,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1: reliable core messaging\n* One WebSocket per tab.\n* IndexedDB message cache.\n* Optimistic sending.\n* Persistent outbox.\n* Server idempotency.\n* History pagination.\n* Reconnect and cursor recovery.\n=====================================\nPhase 2: multi-tab and scale improvements\n* BroadcastChannel synchronization.\n* Leader tab or SharedWorker.\n* Outbox leasing.\n* Virtualized message list.\n* Better cache eviction.\n* Local search worker\n=====================================\nPhase 3: richer product capabilities\n* Images and upload manager.\n* Typing and presence.\n* Edit/delete/reactions.\n* Push notifications.\n* End-to-end encryption.\n* Group conversations.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1: reliable core messaging\n* One WebSocket per tab.\n* IndexedDB message cache.\n* Optimistic sending.\n* Persistent outbox.\n* Server idempotency.\n* History pagination.\n* Reconnect and cursor recovery.\n=====================================\nPhase 2: multi-tab and scale improvements\n* BroadcastChannel synchronization.\n* Leader tab or SharedWorker.\n* Outbox leasing.\n* Virtualized message list.\n* Better cache eviction.\n* Local search worker\n=====================================\nPhase 3: richer product capabilities\n* Images and upload manager.\n* Typing and presence.\n* Edit/delete/reactions.\n* Push notifications.\n* End-to-end encryption.\n* Group conversations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
